  "description": "A ready-to-use distributed task scheduling library based on Quartz.NET.\n      Features: DAG task chains (parent-child relationships with OnSuccess/OnFailure/Always rules),\n      Redis distributed locks with watchdog renewal, Hangfire-style Enqueue,\n      multi-database support (SQL Server / MySQL / PostgreSQL / SQLite), embedded dashboard,\n      and RESTful API for task management.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "QuartzNet.UI",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-22T13:37:10.733Z",
  "licenseExpression": "LGPL-3.0-or-later",
