  "packageSize": 448864,
  "projectUrl": "https://gitee.com/992582781/Quartz.Net.UI",
  "published": "2026-09-22T13:33:01.57Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1 - Bug fixes and improvements\n      - FIX: HttpJob Redis dependency made optional (supports single-instance deployment without Redis)\n      - FIX: QuartzStartupHostedService startup lock Redis dependency made optional\n      - FIX: ContinuationEngine empty catch block now logs deserialization errors\n      - FIX: ReflectionJob uses CancellationToken.None when updating records after timeout (prevents silent record loss)\n      - FIX: Test project strong naming with InternalsVisibleTo\n      - FIX: NSubstitute mock parameter matching for RedisLock tests\n      - IMPROVE: Comprehensive test coverage for core components (ChainEdgeStore, EvaluateRule, ConvertArgument, etc.)\n      - IMPROVE: Detailed documentation (data-execution-path.md and data-execution-path-detailed.md)\n      - IMPROVE: Full code review and bug fixes across the entire class library\n\n      v1.0.0 - Initial release\n      - Cron-based scheduling with standard cron expressions\n      - DAG task chains (parent-child relationships with OnSuccess/OnFailure/Always rules)\n      - Redis distributed locks with watchdog auto-renewal\n      - Hangfire-style Enqueue and RecurringJob API\n      - Multi-database support (SQL Server / MySQL / PostgreSQL / SQLite)\n      - Embedded dashboard for task management\n      - RESTful API for CRUD + Pause/Resume/Trigger/Replay\n      - Snowflake ID generation\n      - Auto table creation on startup",
